WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.053
- Let's dig up something from social media

00:00:02.053 --> 00:00:03.810
sure to make you smile ear to ear.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.564
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.564 --> 00:00:08.700
(intro music)

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.920
When Silvia and her sister, Elba,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.010
lost their catering jobs in 2020,

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.030
Sylvia turned to one of her
favorite things, baking.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.020
For her niece's birthday,

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.140
she designed a cake that
artfully spoke to the times.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.133
She crafted a toilet
paper roll to go on top.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.040
Elba thought it was hilarious,

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.840
so she posted it for her
friends and family to see.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.730
And at the time they had no
idea that that post would lead

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.720
to a new business here in LA
with enough customers that

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.270
they'd never have to
get new jobs. Amazing.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.727
We have Sylvia and Elba
on the line right now.

00:00:38.727 --> 00:00:40.512
"What's up, y'all?

00:00:40.512 --> 00:00:44.008
(cheering and clapping)

00:00:44.008 --> 00:00:49.008
Hi! So tell us about your business."

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.908
- After the post of the toilet paper cake,

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:57.080
people reached out to Sylvia
to make more cakes for them.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.660
And at first it was the little orders

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.070
and then more and more and more

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.950
until we knew we have to open a business.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.900
And then we opened El Mana-

00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:09.629
- Postres.

00:01:09.629 --> 00:01:10.462
- Postres.

00:01:10.462 --> 00:01:11.295
- Wow!

00:01:11.295 --> 00:01:13.210
And now we make cake together

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:18.210
and we have made about 700 cakes so far.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:23.440
- With sculpted cake, they
can take 2 or 3 days to make.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.920
We do dinosaurs, trucks, shoes, purses.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.290
We make a lot of children's shoes.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:32.700
These are the most popular.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.484
We make a lot Dragon Ball Z, Chanel,

00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:42.484
Cocomelon, baby shark,
whatever the customer as for.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.560
- It's amazing. You guys are so talented.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.780
Like, those pictures are
insane. They look real.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:51.130
So wait, what's under the cloth?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.390
What are you hiding?

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:54.860
- Oh! We have a surprise for you, Kelly.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:55.693
- Okay.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.263
- Yes!

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.602
- Yes! What! Oh my gosh. I kid you not,

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.200
literally my daughter, with my money,

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:12.330
she bought my son, he turned
five, and bought him a present.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.890
It was a giant alligator, just like this.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.490
Not a, you know.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.933
They love alligators.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.800
- And then we love to
surprise people, you know,

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.884
and then people want
to surprise their kids

00:02:25.884 --> 00:02:28.700
and then the most important for us

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.970
is the happiness of the kids, you know?

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.060
So we have a surprise here.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.520
Look at this, Kelly.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.723
- Wait, what? Oh my gosh!

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.556
